<title>UK: Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt set warrants on dollar/mark.</title>
<headline>Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt set warrants on dollar/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt says it has issued 80 million European-style call and put warrants, in eight equal tranches, on the U.S. dollar/mark rate.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	 ISS PRICE	MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A	  1.60 DEM     11.20 DEM	16.JUN.97</p>
<p> CALL B	  1.65 DEM	6.35 DEM	16.JUN.97</p>
<p> CALL C	  1.65 DEM	6.60 DEM	15.SEP.97</p>
<p> CALL D	  1.70 DEM	4.10 DEM	15.SEP.97</p>
<p> PUT E	   1.60 DEM	7.15 DEM	16.JUN.97</p>
<p> PUT F	   1.65 DEM     12.40 DEM	16.JUN.97</p>
<p> PUT G	   1.65 DEM     13.40 DEM	15.SEP.97</p>
<p> PUT H	   1.70 DEM     17.50 DEM	15.SEP.97</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   30.JAN.97	    LISTING     DDF FFT STG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
